- [NEW] RAG gladiaio/sdk `sdk-js/src/v2/prerecorded/client.ts`: `uploadFile()` rejects URL strings client-side (`isUrl`, throws), but `create()`/`createUntyped()` POST `audio_url` verbatim to `/v2/pre-recorded` with zero validation/allowlist — server-side fetch of attacker URL remains fully open
- [NEW] RAG gladiaio/sdk `sdk-js`: default `apiUrl=https://api.gladia.io`, key from `GLADIA_API_KEY`/option → `x-gladia-key` header; live session = POST `/v2/live?region=<user-string>` then server-issued WebSocket `session.url` (token embedded server-side)
