- [LEARN] ACCEPTED MISCONFIG @ api.gladia.io: /health ignores `?full=true` — bare `{"health":"OK"}`, no runtime detail leak
- [LEARN] ACCEPTED SSRF @ api.gladia.io: audio_url/video_url server-side fetch confirmed as designed feature (spec + SDK) — class alive, but key-gated and dependent on internal/metadata blocklist
- [LEARN] REJECTED MISCONFIG @ api.gladia.io: CORS wildcard re-confirmed non-exploitable (no allow-credentials; x-gladia-key can't be sent cross-origin)
